 "defectFound": "Three winning attempts (seeds 23, 40, 54) did not win when their pilot.input was replayed with no pilot. Each held one row stamped with the office frame and update 0, last in the file: a touch sent in reply to the last office update landed on the 6 AM frame's first update, which the harness logs with the old frame index because harness_before_events runs before `frame->index` changes. Replayed, the row fires at the office's own update 0, a tap at the start of the night. withoutStrays drops such rows; all three then replay to a win. The harness's stamp is unchanged: other sessions' input rows depend on its update-0 semantics.",
